    "data": {
      "id": 2032,
      "hub_id": 2714,
      "guid": "xyz.drakia.nocheese",
      "name": "NoCheese",
      "slug": "nocheese",
      "teaser": "I'm lactose intolerant, get that cheese away from me!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2714.png",
      "downloads": 2652,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>Can you not help but rage Alt+F4 any time you get smacked in the face by Tagilla? Hate yourself for all the cheese you consume any time you die?</p>\n<p>Well cheese no more, with NoCheese, the simple and effective solution to your cheesing problems.</p>\n<h2><strong>What’s it do?</strong></h2>\n<p>NoCheese catches you any time you Alt+F4 and tells the server “Hey, this guys a big fat phony” like you just died. This means if you alt+f4, you no longer complete the raid, and your character loses all of their equipped items.</p>\n<p>In dire situations (Such as those caused by consuming cheese while lactose intolerant), you <em>can</em> still alt+f4 and then restore a backup of your profile from the <code>SPT/user/profiles/backups/</code> folder, so you can then go suffer the consequences of your cheese ingestion</p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>1) Open the downloaded zip file in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7-zip</a></p>\n<p>2) Select the folder in the zip file in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7-zip</a></p>\n<p>3) Drag the selected folder from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7-zip</a> into your SPT folder</p>\n<p>Demonstration Video (Yes, it’s Live Flea Prices, but the same concept applies to all of my mods, I’m not making mod-specific extraction example videos):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Install Gif\" /></p>\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">feed my caffeine addiction</a></p>\n",
